                        "id":  "skyfall-rock",
                        "title":  "Skyfall Rock",
                        "category":  "Locations",
                        "summary":  "A moss-covered floating rock shifts constantly in the wind and is rumored to make unattended objects disappear.",
                        "body":  [
                                     "A broken statue of an ancient god stands at the center of this restless minor island. Sailors treat the place as cursed because possessions left behind vanish without a trace.",
                                     "The rock can serve as a brief landing place, a shrine mystery, or a lure for investigators willing to test the disappearance stories."
                                 ],
                        "sections":  [

