                        "title":  "Wreck of the Sky Strider",
                        "category":  "Locations",
                        "summary":  "A burned and broken airship wreck shelters delirious survivors who warn of a nearby shadow predator.",
                        "body":  [
                                     "The Sky Strider\u0027s sails are torn and scorched, while portions of the crew still wander the wreck in an altered state. Their warnings suggest that whatever destroyed or stalked the vessel remains close.",
                                     "Rescue, salvage, and investigation all risk attracting the hidden hunter or exposing survivors to further danger."
