                        "id":  "timberheart-grove",
                        "title":  "Timberheart Grove",
                        "category":  "Locations",
                        "summary":  "A drifting grove of gnarled floating trees draws insects, small creatures, and hunters with its sweet scent.",
                        "body":  [
                                     "The grove grows on a cluster of small floating rocks. Its twisted, timber-like bark and heavy fragrance make it recognizable from a distance.",
                                     "Bees fill the air around the trees, and hunters use the grove as a predictable feeding ground while accepting the risks posed by its dense insect life."
                                 ],
                        "sections":  [

                                     ],
