                        "title":  "The Floating Obelisk",
                        "category":  "Locations",
                        "summary":  "A cracked rune-covered obelisk still pulses with energy among scattered magical devices.",
                        "body":  [
                                     "The towering stone monument is damaged but active. Arcane runes retain a faint pulse, and broken devices around its base range from inert debris to mechanisms that still function.",
                                     "The site invites salvage and study, but activating one device may affect the obelisk or awaken systems whose original purpose has been forgotten."
