                        "id":  "crystal-drift",
                        "title":  "The Crystal Drift",
                        "category":  "Locations",
                        "summary":  "A mobile mass of multicolored crystal carries valuable gems through the path of a recurring deadly windstorm.",
                        "body":  [
                                     "Embedded gems attract prospectors and adventurers to the shimmering drift. Its position is unreliable because a periodic storm pushes the entire crystal formation farther across the sky.",
                                     "Mining crews must balance extraction time against weather signs, route changes, and the risk that the formation will carry them away from their vessel."
                                 ],
