                        "title":  "The Lost Aerie",
                        "category":  "Locations",
                        "summary":  "A ruined sky temple carries tattered banners, a distant gong, and ghostly nighttime occupants.",
                        "body":  [
                                     "The stone ruins appear to have served as a temple or sacred aerie. No visible keeper rings the gong that echoes from within, and faded banners still move in the high winds.",
                                     "At night translucent figures cross the grounds, suggesting a surviving ritual, haunting, or memory bound to the complex."
                                 ],
