                        "id":  "lighthouse-of-the-fallen",
                        "title":  "Lighthouse of the Fallen",
                        "category":  "Locations",
                        "summary":  "A broken lighthouse continues to flash an unmaintained beacon near routes once leading dangerously close to the Abyss.",
                        "body":  [
                                     "The tower\u0027s upper structure is shattered, yet its light sometimes returns without any visible keeper. Tradition claims it once warned vessels away from the edge of the [[the-abyss|Abyss]].",
                                     "The intermittent signal may still mark danger, repeat an ancient duty, or deliberately attract ships toward the route it once guarded."
                                 ],
