                        "title":  "The Feathered Nest",
                        "category":  "Locations",
                        "summary":  "An enormous nest on a small floating island is occupied by intelligent or unusually social predatory birds.",
                        "body":  [
                                     "The birds\u0027 large feathers are prized for armor and crafting, drawing hunters and thieves to the island. Approaching the nest can provoke an attack.",
                                     "Some visitors report that the birds instead offer a trade, making patience and careful observation potentially more valuable than force."
