                        "title":  "Glimmerstone Isle",
                        "category":  "Locations",
                        "summary":  "A tiny island glows spectacularly at night, though some apparent stones are venomous fungi in disguise.",
                        "body":  [
                                     "Natural luminous stones turn the island into a visible landmark after dark. Collectors value the display and the material responsible for it.",
                                     "The resemblance between true stones and venomous mushrooms makes careless harvesting dangerous, especially under the island\u0027s shifting light."
