                        "title":  "The Shattered Sundial",
                        "category":  "Locations",
                        "summary":  "A ruined monumental sundial occupies a plateau where sunlight and shadow no longer follow ordinary time.",
                        "body":  [
                                     "Stone and metal pieces from the immense instrument lie scattered across the floating plateau. The sun rarely seems to rise or set while viewed from the site.",
                                     "Unnaturally lengthening shadows and distorted cycles make the ruin a navigational hazard as well as a possible remnant of lost timekeeping magic."
